      "text": "earth was without form, Gen. 1:2 (Moses 2:2). God formed man of the dust, Gen. 2:7 (D&C 77:12; Moses 3:7; Abr. 5:7). God formed every beast, Gen. 2:19. hast forgotten God that formed thee, Deut. 32:18. ever thou hadst formed the earth, Ps. 90:2. great God that formed all things, Prov. 26:10. formed thee from the womb, Isa. 44:2 (49:5; 1 Ne. 21:5). thou art my servant: I have formed thee, Isa. 44:21. he hath no form nor comeliness, Isa. 53:2 (Mosiah 14:2). No weapon that is formed against thee shall prosper, Isa. 54:17 (D&C 71:9; 109:25). Before I formed thee in the belly I knew thee, Jer. 1:5. form of the fourth is like the Son, Dan. 3:25. he that formeth the mountains, Amos 4:13.",
